\"\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q}\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\vec Q}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFO}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFO}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\">\\(\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LS}\">\\(\\mathrm{LS}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"226cc20b75e0d203\" href=\"?note=226cc20b75e0d203\" title=\"67-df-compactness-property\">67-df-compactness-property</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8f108f9f48f06aa6\" href=\"?note=8f108f9f48f06aa6\" title=\"67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property\">67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property</a>。</li>\n<li>正则性、紧致性及向下 LS 性质均作为下式显式前提；本条不从量词的单独语义不变性推断正则性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{LS}(\\mathcal L)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RegFO}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{LS}(\\mathcal L)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal L\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条直接实例化本册 Lindström 特征定理。采用相同载体上的一阶结构语义；可表达能力等价由逐句、逐签名的真值等价定义，而不是未指定的逻辑对象等号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-generalized-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"1a5df6cf30c97026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"